+# Spec Delta
+
+## Purpose
+Coupon discounts: what a coupon is computed on and on which days it is valid.
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Percentage coupon applies to the subtotal after volume discounts
+A percentage coupon SHALL take its percentage of the order's subtotal after volume discounts, rounded half
+up to the cent, subject to the 50% cap on the gross amount.
+
+#### Scenario: Volume discount and 10% coupon
+- **WHEN** 12 units at 500 cents (gross 6000, volume discount 600, subtotal 5400) use a 10% coupon
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 540 cents off and the goods are 4860 cents
+
+#### Scenario: Half a cent rounds up
+- **WHEN** the subtotal after volume discounts is 1005 cents and the coupon is 10% (100.5 cents)
+- **THEN** the coupon takes 101 cents off
+
+#### Scenario: Cap on gross
+- **WHEN** gross is 6000, volume discount 600 and a 50% coupon would take 2700
+- **THEN** the coupon is reduced to 2400 so all discounts total 3000 (50% of gross)
+
+### Requirement: Coupon valid on its first and last day
+A coupon SHALL be valid on every day from its first day to its last day, both included.
+
+#### Scenario: Last day
+- **WHEN** coupon AUTUMN is valid until 2026-11-30 and an order is placed on 2026-11-30
+- **THEN** the coupon is accepted
+
+#### Scenario: Day after the last day
+- **WHEN** the same order is placed on 2026-12-01
+- **THEN** the coupon is refused as expired
+
+#### Scenario: First day and day before
+- **WHEN** a coupon is valid from 2026-10-01 and orders are placed on 2026-10-01 and 2026-09-30
+- **THEN** the first is accepted and the second is refused as not valid yet
