+- **THEN** the coupon takes 101 cents off
+
+#### Scenario: Cap on gross
+- **WHEN** gross is 6000, volume discount 600 and a 50% coupon would take 2700
+- **THEN** the coupon is reduced to 2400 so all discounts total 3000 (50% of gross)
+
+### Requirement: Coupon valid on its first and last day
+A coupon SHALL be valid on every day from its first day to its last day, both included.
+
+#### Scenario: Last day
+- **WHEN** coupon AUTUMN is valid until 2026-11-30 and an order is placed on 2026-11-30
+- **THEN** the coupon is accepted
